WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.973
AI tools sometimes make things up. In this lesson, you will learn how to check their answers.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:12.036
Confirm facts and numbers with a trusted source, like an official website or a textbook.

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:17.435
Names, dates and laws are often wrong or out of date, especially for Liberia.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:22.883
If the AI gives a link or a book, open it, and make sure it is real.

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:27.474
For health, money or legal questions, always ask a qualified person.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:34.407
AI learns from data that may not represent everyone. Ask: does this answer fit my community?

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:46.303
Before you move on, check: Check one AI fact with a trusted source. Open any source the AI gives you. Ask an expert before health, money or legal actions.

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:50.107
In the next lesson: AI for study and work.
